te&nbsp;of&nbsp;Legal&nbsp;Education.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">🍀&nbsp;Nội&nbsp;dung:</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">1.&nbsp;This&nbsp;talk&nbsp;examines&nbsp;both&nbsp;the&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;practical&nbsp;realities&nbsp;of&nbsp;applying&nbsp;large&nbsp;language&nbsp;models&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;legal&nbsp;domain.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">2.&nbsp;The&nbsp;talk&nbsp;explores&nbsp;how&nbsp;legal&nbsp;AI&nbsp;can&nbsp;already&nbsp;create&nbsp;meaningful&nbsp;value&nbsp;for&nbsp;lawyers,&nbsp;while&nbsp;highlighting&nbsp;the&nbsp;technical&nbsp;and&nbsp;operational&nbsp;challenges&nbsp;that&nbsp;continue&nbsp;to&nbsp;limit&nbsp;adoption.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">🌈&nbsp;Thông&nbsp;tin&nbsp;chi&nbsp;tiết&nbsp;về&nbsp;chương&nbsp;trình&nbsp;và&nbsp;diễn&nbsp;giả,&nbsp;các&nbsp;bạn&nbsp;vui&nbsp;lòng&nbsp;xem&nbsp;tại:&nbsp;</span><a href="https://link.hcmus.edu.vn/Info_Seminar29062026?fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFiZ2lFZktoeXM3eTlLREF5c3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHhnlP4GFv1_oxCMM6J_JjI8VZnypJoM3iKpj8VIbQC0DogcuzvsF7awU_mlF_aem_a_Bp9XgnWjVbn70mfl7esg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 100, 209);">https://link.hcmus.edu.vn/Info_Seminar29062026</a></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">👉&nbsp;Các&nbsp;bạn&nbsp;Học&nbsp;viên&nbsp;và&nbsp;Sinh&nbsp;viên&nbsp;quan&nbsp;tâm,&nbsp;vui&nbsp;lòng&nbsp;đăng&nbsp;ký&nbsp;qua&nbsp;link:&nbsp;</span><a href="https://link.hcmus.edu.vn/Dangky_Seminar29062026?fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFiZ2lFZktoeXM3eTlLREF5c3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHrtvUTjkqSu1jRfnQQ6EEy8570ardxS8UOX1wFsWEToiPIUGs05iekmSsXX5_aem_UlnVKQIvjO77XnH5sSTSBQ" rel="noopener nore