15	1	11	f	INTERNSHIP	[Internship - Q1 - GeoComply] - Mobile Security Engineer Intern – Forensics	\N	\N	\N	<p data-main-image-caption="true" class="article-main-image-caption">Mobile Security Engineer Intern – Forensics</p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">✨About&nbsp;GeoComply</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">We’re&nbsp;GeoComply!&nbsp;We&nbsp;are&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;forefront&nbsp;of&nbsp;geolocation,&nbsp;cybersecurity,&nbsp;and&nbsp;anti-fraud&nbsp;innovation,&nbsp;developing&nbsp;and&nbsp;delivering&nbsp;cutting-edge&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;to&nbsp;help&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;regulatory&nbsp;compliance,&nbsp;combat&nbsp;bad&nbsp;online&nbsp;actors,&nbsp;alleviate&nbsp;user&nbsp;friction,&nbsp;and&nbsp;protect&nbsp;businesses&nbsp;from&nbsp;fraud.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">Achieving&nbsp;significant&nbsp;business&nbsp;and&nbsp;revenue&nbsp;growth&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;past&nbsp;three&nbsp;years&nbsp;and&nbsp;dubbed&nbsp;a&nbsp;tech&nbsp;“Unicorn,”&nbsp;GeoComply&nbsp;has&nbsp;been&nbsp;trusted&nbsp;by&nbsp;leading&nbsp;global&nbsp;brands&nbsp;and&nbsp;regulators&nbsp;for&nbsp;over&nbsp;ten&nbsp;years.&nbsp;Our&nbsp;compliance-grade&nbsp;geolocation&nbsp;technology&nbsp;solutions&nbsp;are&nbsp;installed&nbsp;on&nbsp;over&nbsp;400&nbsp;million&nbsp;devices&nbsp;and&nbsp;analyze&nbsp;over&nbsp;12&nbsp;billion&nbsp;transactions&nbsp;a&nbsp;year.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">At&nbsp;the&nbsp;heart&nbsp;of&nbsp;it&nbsp;all&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;people,&nbsp;united&nbsp;by&nbsp;a&nbsp;deep&nbsp;commitment&nbsp;to&nbsp;problem-solving&nbsp;and&nbsp;revolutionizing&nbsp;how&nbsp;people&nbsp;and&nbsp;businesses&nbsp;use&nbsp;the&nbsp;internet&nbsp;to&nbsp;instill&nbsp;confidence&nbsp;in&nbsp;every&nbsp;online&nbsp;interaction.&nbsp;With&nbsp;teams&nbsp;across&nbsp;five&nbsp;countries,&nbsp;three&nbsp;continents,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;global&nbsp;customer&nbsp;base,&nbsp;we&nbsp;have&nbsp;no&nbsp;plans&nbsp;to&nbsp;slow&nbsp;down.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">📌The&nbsp;Role</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">This&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;pivotal&nbsp;role&nbsp;that&nbsp;places&nbsp;you&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;front&nbsp;lines&nbsp;of&nbsp;protecting&nbsp;millions&nbsp;of&nbsp;users&nbsp;and&nbsp;our&nbsp;systems&nbsp;from&nbsp;sophisticated&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;fraud&nbsp;and&nbsp;adversarial&nbsp;attacks.&nbsp;As&nbsp;a&nbsp;Mobile&nbsp;Security&nbsp;Engineer&nbsp;Intern&nbsp;(Forensics)&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;design,&nbsp;build,&nbsp;and&nbsp;operate&nbsp;systems&nbsp;that&nbsp;investigate,&nbsp;analyze,&nbsp;and&nbsp;attribute&nbsp;fraudulent&nbsp;and&nbsp;malicious&nbsp;activity&nbsp;across&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;platforms.&nbsp;This&nbsp;role&nbsp;focuses&nbsp;on&nbsp;forensic&nbsp;signal&nbsp;collection,&nbsp;signal&nbsp;integrity,&nbsp;attacker&nbsp;behavior&nbsp;reconstruction,&nbsp;and&nbsp;incident&nbsp;response&nbsp;on&nbsp;both&nbsp;Android&nbsp;and&nbsp;iOS&nbsp;environments.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">You&nbsp;will&nbsp;work&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;full&nbsp;forensic&nbsp;lifecycle—from&nbsp;secure&nbsp;on-device&nbsp;signal&nbsp;collection&nbsp;to&nbsp;evidence&nbsp;preservation,&nbsp;large-scale&nbsp;data&nbsp;analysis,&nbsp;and&nbsp;investigative&nbsp;tooling—to&nbsp;uncover&nbsp;sophisticated&nbsp;fraud,&nbsp;spoofing,&nbsp;and&nbsp;abuse.&nbsp;Sitting&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;intersection&nbsp;of&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;engineering,&nbsp;security,&nbsp;data&nbsp;analysis,&nbsp;and&nbsp;incident&nbsp;response,&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;help&nbsp;identify&nbsp;adversarial&nbsp;techniques,&nbsp;strengthen&nbsp;detection&nbsp;systems,&nbsp;and&nbsp;protect&nbsp;users&nbsp;at&nbsp;scale.Our&nbsp;program&nbsp;is&nbsp;designed&nbsp;to&nbsp;help&nbsp;you&nbsp;discover&nbsp;your&nbsp;potential&nbsp;in&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;world’s&nbsp;fastest-growing&nbsp;industries.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">📌Key&nbsp;Responsibilities</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Analyze&nbsp;large-scale&nbsp;datasets&nbsp;and&nbsp;fraud&nbsp;incidents&nbsp;to&nbsp;uncover&nbsp;attack&nbsp;patterns,&nbsp;fraud&nbsp;clusters,&nbsp;and&nbsp;evolving&nbsp;adversarial&nbsp;behavior,&nbsp;including&nbsp;reconstructing&nbsp;attacker&nbsp;techniques&nbsp;and&nbsp;execution&nbsp;paths.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Design&nbsp;and&nbsp;implement&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;SDK&nbsp;components&nbsp;to&nbsp;securely&nbsp;collect&nbsp;forensic-grade&nbsp;signals,&nbsp;enabling&nbsp;attribution&nbsp;of&nbsp;location&nbsp;spoofing,&nbsp;emulator&nbsp;abuse,&nbsp;rooted/jailbroken&nbsp;environments,&nbsp;and&nbsp;other&nbsp;environment&nbsp;manipulation.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Research&nbsp;emerging&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;fraud&nbsp;and&nbsp;evasion&nbsp;techniques,&nbsp;translating&nbsp;findings&nbsp;into&nbsp;actionable&nbsp;forensic&nbsp;indicators.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Build&nbsp;end-to-end&nbsp;incident&nbsp;response&nbsp;capabilities&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;stack,&nbsp;partnering&nbsp;with&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;and&nbsp;ML&nbsp;teams&nbsp;to&nbsp;translate&nbsp;forensic&nbsp;insights&nbsp;into&nbsp;technical&nbsp;features,&nbsp;rules,&nbsp;and&nbsp;detection&nbsp;logic.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">📌Who&nbsp;You&nbsp;Are</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Deep&nbsp;passion&nbsp;for&nbsp;investigating&nbsp;security&nbsp;incidents,&nbsp;hunting&nbsp;attackers,&nbsp;and&nbsp;uncovering&nbsp;sophisticated&nbsp;fraud,&nbsp;spoofing,&nbsp;and&nbsp;abuse&nbsp;patterns,&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;strong&nbsp;curiosity&nbsp;for&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;how&nbsp;adversaries&nbsp;operate&nbsp;and&nbsp;evade&nbsp;defenses.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Pursuing&nbsp;or&nbsp;recently&nbsp;graduated&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;bachelor’s&nbsp;degree&nbsp;in&nbsp;Security&nbsp;Engineering&nbsp;and&nbsp;Computer&nbsp;Science&nbsp;or&nbsp;Computer&nbsp;Engineering&nbsp;or&nbsp;a&nbsp;similar&nbsp;field&nbsp;of&nbsp;study,&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;strong&nbsp;academic&nbsp;foundation&nbsp;(e.g.,&nbsp;solid&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;structures,&nbsp;algorithms,&nbsp;and&nbsp;fundamental&nbsp;security&nbsp;principles)</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;data&nbsp;analysis&nbsp;(SQL,&nbsp;data&nbsp;modeling,&nbsp;feature&nbsp;extraction).</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Familiarity&nbsp;with&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;concepts&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;role&nbsp;of&nbsp;ML&nbsp;in&nbsp;detection&nbsp;systems</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Strong&nbsp;English&nbsp;communication&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;ability&nbsp;to&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;document&nbsp;findings&nbsp;and&nbsp;explain&nbsp;technical&nbsp;investigations.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">📌Bonus&nbsp;Points</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;development&nbsp;(Android,&nbsp;iOS,&nbsp;or&nbsp;cross-platform).</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Familiarity&nbsp;with&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;security&nbsp;and&nbsp;forensics,&nbsp;including:&nbsp;Root&nbsp;/&nbsp;jailbreak&nbsp;detection&nbsp;and&nbsp;evasion&nbsp;techniques</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Emulator&nbsp;and&nbsp;virtualized&nbsp;environment&nbsp;detection</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Location&nbsp;spoofing&nbsp;and&nbsp;geolocation&nbsp;integrity&nbsp;validation</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Device&nbsp;attestation,&nbsp;TEE,&nbsp;Secure&nbsp;Enclave,&nbsp;and&nbsp;hardware-backed&nbsp;security</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Interest&nbsp;in&nbsp;incident&nbsp;response,&nbsp;threat&nbsp;research,&nbsp;or&nbsp;adversarial&nbsp;analysis.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">👉Apply&nbsp;Now!</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">JD:&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.geocomply.com/careers/all-jobs/ho-chi-minh-mobile-security-engineer-intern-forensics/?fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFTWlc3N3ZMOXdHQ1pxbTlGc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHpl7MN8Bqr0xBy3P_VjPnKrwVKbhUQx7TZ93FL2bAZD0sG0Wy8Xp19bzh1bg_aem_L3z-usWIEHN7rRrdy4AbDA" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 100, 209);">https://www.geocomply.com/.../ho-chi-minh-mobile.../</a></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">Interested&nbsp;in&nbsp;joining&nbsp;our&nbsp;team?&nbsp;Send&nbsp;us&nbsp;your&nbsp;resume&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;cover&nbsp;letter.&nbsp;We&nbsp;can’t&nbsp;wait&nbsp;to&nbsp;meet&nbsp;you!</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 2