e,&nbsp;and&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;teams,&nbsp;we&nbsp;ensure</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">seamless&nbsp;integration&nbsp;and&nbsp;optimal&nbsp;performance&nbsp;of&nbsp;AI-driven&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;in&nbsp;cutting-edge&nbsp;security&nbsp;systems.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">💥&nbsp;Job&nbsp;Description</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">As&nbsp;a&nbsp;System&nbsp;Development&nbsp;Engineer,&nbsp;you&nbsp;sit&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;high-velocity&nbsp;intersection&nbsp;of&nbsp;Software&nbsp;Engineering&nbsp;and&nbsp;Systems&nbsp;Architecture,&nbsp;building&nbsp;the&nbsp;sophisticated&nbsp;tooling&nbsp;that&nbsp;allows&nbsp;our&nbsp;systems&nbsp;to&nbsp;provide&nbsp;the&nbsp;highest&nbsp;quality&nbsp;service.&nbsp;You&nbsp;will&nbsp;design&nbsp;and&nbsp;implement&nbsp;world-class&nbsp;Continuous&nbsp;Integration&nbsp;and&nbsp;Deployment&nbsp;frameworks.&nbsp;You&nbsp;will&nbsp;treat&nbsp;our&nbsp;internal&nbsp;infrastructure&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;product,&nbsp;developing&nbsp;high-performance&nbsp;internal&nbsp;tools,&nbsp;APIs,&nbsp;and&nbsp;CLI&nbsp;utilities&nbsp;to&nbsp;automate&nbsp;complex&nbsp;operational&nbsp;logic.&nbsp;You&nbsp;will&nbsp;lead&nbsp;the&nbsp;charge&nbsp;in&nbsp;Infrastructure&nbsp;as&nbsp;Code&nbsp;(IaC)&nbsp;and&nbsp;build&nbsp;self-healing&nbsp;systems&nbsp;and&nbsp;automated&nbsp;remediation&nbsp;workflows&nbsp;that&nbsp;detect&nbsp;and&nbsp;fix&nbsp;issues&nbsp;before&nbsp;a&nbsp;human&nbsp;ever&nbsp;sees&nbsp;an&nbsp;alert.&nbsp;You’ll&nbsp;bake&nbsp;security&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;DNA&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;systems.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">🎯&nbsp;Key&nbsp;Responsibilities</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Architecting&nbsp;the&nbsp;CI/CD&nbsp;Engine:&nbsp;Design,&nbsp;build,&nbsp;and&nbsp;optimize&nbsp;high-speed&nbsp;deployment&nbsp;pipelines.&nbsp;You&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;it’s&nbsp;tested,&nbsp;secured,&nbsp;and&nbsp;deployed&nbsp;with&nbsp;zero&nbsp;downtime&nbsp;using&nbsp;Canary&nbsp;and&nbsp;Blue/Green&nbsp;strategies.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Engineering&nbsp;Internal&nbsp;Platforms:&nbsp;You&nbsp;will&nbsp;treat&nbsp;internal&nbsp;services&nbsp;as&nbsp;products,&nbsp;developing&nbsp;APIs,&nbsp;custom&nbsp;CLI&nbsp;tools,&nbsp;and&nbsp;dashboards&nbsp;that&nbsp;empower&nbsp;software&nbsp;teams&nbsp;to&nbsp;self-serve&nbsp;infrastructure.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Radical&nbsp;Automation&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;IaC:&nbsp;Eliminate&nbsp;manual&nbsp;toil&nbsp;by&nbsp;codifying&nbsp;everything.&nbsp;You&nbsp;will&nbsp;manage&nbsp;global-scale&nbsp;infrastructure&nbsp;using&nbsp;Infrastructure&nbsp;as&nbsp;Code&nbsp;(IaC),&nbsp;ensuring&nbsp;environments&nbsp;are&nbsp;reproducible,&nbsp;version-controlled,&nbsp;and&nbsp;immutable.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Advanced&nbsp;Escalation&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Reliability:&nbsp;Act&nbsp;as&nbsp;the&nbsp;"Engineer’s&nbsp;Engineer."&nbsp;You&nbsp;provide&nbsp;support&nbsp;for&nbsp;complex&nbsp;distributed&nbsp;systems&nbsp;failures,&nbsp;performing&nbsp;deep-dive&nbsp;root&nbsp;cause&nbsp;analysis&nbsp;(RCA)&nbsp;and&nbsp;writing&nbsp;code&nbsp;to&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;failure&nbsp;mode&nbsp;never&nbsp;happens&nbsp;twice.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Performance&nbsp;Tuning&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Observability:&nbsp;Build&nbsp;the&nbsp;"eyes&nbsp;and&nbsp;ears"&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;systems.&nbsp;You&nbsp;will&nbsp;implement&nbsp;advanced&nbsp;telemetry,&nbsp;distributed&nbsp;tracing,&nbsp;and&nbsp;automated&nbsp;alerting&nbsp;to&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;high&nbsp;availability&nbsp;and&nbsp;peak&nbsp;performance.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Replicate&nbsp;complex&nbsp;customer&nbsp;deployment&nbsp;environments&nbsp;to&nbsp;execute&nbsp;comprehensive&nbsp;system&nbsp;integration&nbsp;and&nbsp;stability&nbsp;testing.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Cybersecurity&nbsp;Compliance&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Global&nbsp;Standards:&nbsp;Ensure&nbsp;that&nbsp;our&nbsp;systems&nbsp;meet/exceed&nbsp;strict&nbsp;global&nbsp;security&nbsp;standards.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">💥&nbsp;Basic&nbsp;Requirements</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">✅Education&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Experience</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;2&nbsp;-&nbsp;5&nbsp;years&nbsp;of&nbsp;experience&nbsp;in&nbsp;system&nbsp;development,&nbsp;integration&nbsp;engineering,&nbsp;or&nbsp;QA&nbsp;automation.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Bachelor&nbsp;Degree&nbsp;or&nbsp;Master&nbsp;Degree&nbsp;in&nbsp;Software&nbsp;Engineering,&nbsp;Computer&nbsp;Science&nbsp;or&nbsp;any&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;field.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">✅Technical&nbsp;Competencies</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Proficiency&nbsp;in&nbsp;object&nbsp;oriented&nbsp;and&nbsp;scripting&nbsp;programming&nbsp;languages</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Strong&nbsp;Linux/Unix&nbsp;internals&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;firm&nbsp;grasp&nbsp;of&nbsp;networking&nbsp;protocols&nbsp;(TCP/IP,&nbsp;DNS,&nbsp;HTTP/3).</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">✅Language&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Soft&nbsp;Skills</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Advanced&nbsp;verbal&nbsp;and&nbsp;written&nbsp;English&nbsp;communication&nbsp;skills&nbsp;are&nbsp;required.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Strong&nbsp;analytical&nbsp;mind&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;proactive&nbsp;approach&nbsp;to&nbsp;breaking&nbsp;down&nbsp;and&nbsp;solving&nbsp;complex&nbsp;technical&nbsp;puzzles.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Constant&nbsp;learner&nbsp;who&nbsp;proactively&nbsp;works&nbsp;through&nbsp;ambiguity.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">💥&nbsp;What&nbsp;We&nbsp;Offer</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;The&nbsp;unique&nbsp;opportunity&nbsp;to&nbsp;build&nbsp;and&nbsp;pioneer&nbsp;global&nbsp;security&nbsp;products&nbsp;directly&nbsp;out&nbsp;of&nbsp;Vietnam's&nbsp;thriving&nbsp;innovation&nbsp;center.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;An&nbsp;international,&nbsp;diverse,&nbsp;and&nbsp;multicultural&nbsp;R&amp;D&nbsp;culture&nbsp;guided&nbsp;by&nbsp;world-class&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientists&nbsp;and&nbsp;chief&nbsp;engineers.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">-&nbsp;Competitive&nbsp;salary&nbsp;and&nbsp;bonuses.</span></p><p></p><h3><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">👉&nbsp;Contact</span></h3><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">Ms.&nbsp;Nhung&nbsp;Hoang</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 9);">Email:&nbsp;nhung.hoang@motorolasolutions.com</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255