nged.&nbsp;It&nbsp;was&nbsp;popularised&nbsp;thanks&nbsp;to&nbsp;these&nbsp;sheets&nbsp;and&nbsp;more&nbsp;recently&nbsp;with&nbsp;desktop&nbsp;publishing&nbsp;software&nbsp;like&nbsp;Aldus&nbsp;PageMaker&nbsp;and&nbsp;Microsoft&nbsp;Word&nbsp;including&nbsp;versions&nbsp;of&nbsp;Lorem&nbsp;Ipsum.</span></p><h2><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Why&nbsp;do&nbsp;we&nbsp;use&nbsp;it?</span></h2><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">It&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;long&nbsp;established&nbsp;fact&nbsp;that&nbsp;a&nbsp;reader&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;distracted&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;readable&nbsp;content&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;page&nbsp;when&nbsp;looking&nbsp;at&nbsp;its&nbsp;layout.&nbsp;The&nbsp;point&nbsp;of&nbsp;using&nbsp;Lorem&nbsp;Ipsum&nbsp;is&nbsp;that&nbsp;it&nbsp;has&nbsp;a&nbsp;more-or-less&nbsp;normal&nbsp;distribution&nbsp;of&nbsp;letters,&nbsp;as&nbsp;opposed&nbsp;to&nbsp;using&nbsp;'Content&nbsp;here,&nbsp;content&nbsp;here',&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;look&nbsp;like&nbsp;readable&nbsp;English.&nbsp;Many&nbsp;desktop&nbsp;publishing&nbsp;packages&nbsp;and&nbsp;web&nbsp;page&nbsp;editors&nbsp;now&nbsp;use&nbsp;Lorem&nbsp;Ipsum&nbsp;as&nbsp;their&nbsp;default&nbsp;model&nbsp;text,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;search&nbsp;for&nbsp;'lorem&nbsp;ipsum'&nbsp;will&nbsp;uncover&nbsp;many&nbsp;web&nbsp;sites&nbsp;still&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;infancy.&nbsp;Various&nbsp;versions&nbsp;have&nbsp;evolved&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;years,&nbsp;sometimes&nbsp;by&nbsp;accident,&nbsp;sometimes&nbsp;on&nbsp;purpose&nbsp;(injected&nbsp;humour&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;like).</span></p><p></p><h2><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Where&nbsp;does&nbsp;it&nbsp;come&nbsp;from?</span></h2><p class="ql-align-justify"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Contrary&nbsp;to&nbsp;popular&nbsp;belief,&nbsp;Lorem&nbsp;Ipsum&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nb